From: RG DS <rgds@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] libretro: export the per-line Mode 7 state for RG DS Play

RG DS Play draws more of a Mode 7 race than the game itself draws (Super
Mario Kart's road under the race view) from the core's own record of each
scanline's Mode 7 matrix, centre and scroll and the palette. The unix
version script exports only retro_*; export those two tables as well (read
only; nothing in the core changes).

--- a/libretro/link.T
+++ b/libretro/link.T
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 {
-   global: retro_*;
+   global: retro_*; LineMatrixData; PPU;
    local: *;
 };
